      <div className="board-row">
        <Square />
        <Square />
        <Square />
      </div>
    </>
  );
}
```
Now you’ll change `Square` to display an “X” when clicked. Replace the `console.log("clicked!");` event handler with `setValue('X');`. Now your `Square` component looks like this:

```
